<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND BEAT PAKISTAN BY SEVEN WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NEW ZEALAND BEAT PAKISTAN BY SEVEN WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand beat Pakistan by seven wickets in the third and final one-day international on Sunday. Pakistan won the series 2-1.</p>
<p>Scores: Pakistan 234-4 in 50 overs, New Zealand 235-3 in 45.1 overs.</p>
